@startuml
title Task 2.3 - Domain Class Diagram: BrewLite
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontSize 16
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam class {
  BackgroundColor #F8FAFC
  BorderColor #42546B
  ArrowColor #42546B
  FontName Arial
}
skinparam enum {
  BackgroundColor #FFF4CC
  BorderColor #B08900
  FontName Arial
}

class UserEntity <<TypeORM entity>> {
  +id: UUID
  +email: String
  +passwordHash: String
  +loyaltyPoints: integer
  +role: CUSTOMER | STAFF
  +createdAt: DateTime
}
class ProductCatalogItem <<in-memory catalog>> {
  +id: integer
  +name: String
  +price: integer
  +image: String
}
class OrderEntity <<TypeORM entity>> {
  +id: UUID
  +status: OrderStatus
  +totalAmount: integer
  +createdAt: DateTime
  +userId: UUID?
}
class OrderItemEntity <<TypeORM entity>> {
  +id: UUID
  +orderId: UUID
  +productId: integer
  +productName: String
  +size: S | M | L
  +toppings: OrderToppingSnapshot[]
  +quantity: integer
  +unitPrice: integer
  +lineTotal: integer
}
class PaymentEntity <<TypeORM entity>> {
  +id: UUID
  +orderId: UUID
  +userId: UUID?
  +method: WALLET | CARD
  +status: SUCCESS | FAILED
  +amount: integer
  +idempotencyKey: String?
  +requestHash: String?
  +resultSnapshot: JSON?
  +createdAt: DateTime
  +updatedAt: DateTime
}

enum OrderStatus {
  PENDING
  PAYMENT_FAILED
  PAID
  PREPARING
  READY
  COMPLETED
  CANCELLED
}
UserEntity "0..1" -- "0..*" OrderEntity : owns
OrderEntity "1" *-- "1..*" OrderItemEntity : contains
OrderEntity "1" -- "0..*" PaymentEntity : has attempts
UserEntity "0..1" -- "0..*" PaymentEntity : initiates
ProductCatalogItem "1" .. "0..*" OrderItemEntity : productId/name snapshot
note right of ProductCatalogItem
The catalog is defined in ProductsService,
not persisted as a TypeORM entity.
OrderItem stores productId and productName;
there is no database foreign key to this catalog.
end note
note bottom of OrderItemEntity
Size and toppings are order-item snapshots.
Prices are calculated by OrdersService.
end note
@enduml
